\f0\fs40 \cf2 Steroid eye drops can be very helpful for reducing inflammation and improving comfort during flare-ups. However, they need to be used carefully. Overuse can increase the risk of side effects such as elevated eye pressure, infection, or delayed healing.\
\
It is important to use these drops only as directed. Short courses are generally safe, but frequent or prolonged use should be monitored.\
\
Key points to keep in mind:\
\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li680\fi-360\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 1. Use the drops only when needed and for the shortest duration necessary.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li740\fi-420\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 2. Be aware of any new symptoms such as increasing redness, pain, light sensitivity, or worsening vision.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li760\fi-440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 3. If symptoms are not improving as expected, or are getting worse, stop the drops and contact the clinic.\
